    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body": "### Problem\n\non Windows, when `$XDG_*` is defined, Nvim uses `$XDG_*/nvim-data` for things like `stdpath(\"data\")`. witch is inconsistent with other systems, and redundant.\n\n### Expected behavior\n\nuse `$XDG_*/nvim`, like on other systems",
