            "body": "> when `$XDG_*` is defined\n\nThat's an edge case we didn't consider. Since it's unusual to define them on Windows. \n\nYes, technically the `nvim-data` separation isn't necessary when `$XDG_*` env vars are defined, but it's very late to change it, and it's a very small inconsistency, so not worth the trouble.",
